      "📌 Definition of 1 u: 1 u = 1.66056 × 10⁻²⁴ g = 1 / N_A grams approximately.",
      "📌 Number of Atoms per Gram: Number of atoms in 1 g of an element = N_A / Atomic Mass. The element with the smallest atomic mass has the largest number of atoms per gram (e.g., 1 g of Hydrogen has more atoms than 1 g of Gold).",
      "📌 Average Atomic Mass of Isotopes: A_avg = [(A₁ × %₁) + (A₂ × %₂)] / 100. For Chlorine (³⁵Cl 75% and ³⁷Cl 25%), A_avg = (35 × 75 + 37 × 25)/100 = 35.5 u.",
