          "• Step B: Determine the multiplication factor n using the equation:nn = (Molecular Molar Mass) / (Empirical Formula Mass)",
          "• Step C: Multiply all subscripts in the empirical formula by the integer n:nMolecular Formula = (Empirical Formula) × n",
          "• Note on Vapor Density: For gaseous or volatile substances, NEET questions frequently provide Vapor Density instead of Molar Mass. Use the relationship:n Molar Mass = 2 × Vapor Density."
