    "question": "A binary liquid mixture contains 46.0 g of ethanol (C₂H₅OH) and 54.0 g of water (H₂O). What is the mole fraction of ethanol in this solution? (Molar masses: ethanol = 46.0 g/mol, water = 18.0 g/mol)",
