          "svgContent": "<svg viewBox='0 0 800 200' class='w-full h-auto max-h-52' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'>\n          <rect width='800' height='200' rx='16' fill='#0f172a' />\n          <g transform='translate(110, 100)'>\n            <rect x='-65' y='-45' width='130' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1e293b' stroke='#38bdf8' stroke-width='2.5' />\n            <text x='0' y='-15' text-anchor='middle' fill='#38bdf8' font-size='20' font-weight='extrabold'>n</text>\n            <text x='0' y='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#ffffff' font-size='12' font-weight='bold'>Principal</text>\n            <text x='0' y='30' text-anchor='middle' fill='#94a3b8' font-size='10'>Shell Size & Energy</text>\n          </g>\n          <g transform='translate(300, 100)'>\n            <rect x='-65' y='-45' width='130' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1e293b' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='2.5' />\n            <text x='0' y='-15' text-anchor='middle' fill='#34d399' font-size='20' font-weight='extrabold'>l</text>\n            <text x='0' y='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#ffffff' font-size='12' font-weight='bold'>Azimuthal</text>\n            <text x='0' y='30' text-anchor='middle' fill='#94a3b8' font-size='10'>Subshell Shape (s,p,d,f)</text>\n          </g>\n          <g transform='translate(490, 100)'>\n            <rect x='-65' y='-45' width='130' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1e293b' stroke='#f59e0b' stroke-width='2.5' />\n            <text x='0' y='-15' text-anchor='middle' fill='#fbbf24' font-size='20' font-weight='extrabold'>m_l</text>\n            <text x='0' y='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#ffffff' font-size='12' font-weight='bold'>Magnetic</text>\n            <text x='0' y='30' text-anchor='middle' fill='#94a3b8' font-size='10'>Spatial Orientation</text>\n          </g>\n          <g transform='translate(680, 100)'>\n            <rect x='-65' y='-45' width='130' height='90' rx='10' fill='#1e293b' stroke='#a855f7' stroke-width='2.5' />\n            <text x='0' y='-15' text-anchor='middle' fill='#c084fc' font-size='20' font-weight='extrabold'>m_s</text>\n            <text x='0' y='10' text-anchor='middle' fill='#ffffff' font-size='12' font-weight='bold'>Spin</text>\n            <text x='0' y='30' text-anchor='middle' fill='#94a3b8' font-size='10'>Spin (+1/2 or -1/2)</text>\n          </g>\n        </svg>"
