        "term": "(n + l) Energy Rule",
        "symbol": "Bohr-Bury Rule",
        "definition": "Rule stating that lower value of (n + l) corresponds to lower orbital energy. If two orbitals share the same (n + l), the orbital with lower n has lower energy.",
