          "  (3) H₂(g) + ½ O₂(g) ➔ H₂O(l), ΔH₃ = −285.8 kJ",
          "  Target Eq: 2 C(s) + 2 H₂(g) ➔ C₂H₄(g).",
          "  Solution: Multiply eq (2) by 2: 2 C(s) + 2 O₂ ➔ 2 CO₂, ΔH = 2(−393.5) = −787.0 kJ.",
          "  Multiply eq (3) by 2: 2 H₂ + O₂ ➔ 2 H₂O, ΔH = 2(−285.8) = −571.6 kJ.",
          "  Reverse eq (1): 2 CO₂ + 2 H₂O ➔ C₂H₄ + 3 O₂, ΔH = +1411 kJ.",
          "  Summing: 2 C(s) + 2 H₂(g) ➔ C₂H₄(g).",
          "  Δ_f H° = (−787.0) + (−571.6) + (+1411.0) = +52.4 kJ mol⁻¹."
