        "title": "Parallel Equivalent Resistance",
        "formula": "\\frac{1}{R_{\\text{parallel}}} = \\frac{1}{R_1} + \\frac{1}{R_2} + \\frac{1}{R_3}",
        "meaning": "The reciprocal of the equivalent resistance of parallel components equals the sum of reciprocals of individual resistances.",
        "symbols": "R_parallel = total equivalent resistance (Ω); R₁, R₂, R₃ = branch resistance values (Ω).",
        "unit": "Ohm (Ω)",
