    "whatIsThisTopic": "The cell is the fundamental structural and functional unit of all living organisms. Eukaryotic cells possess a membrane-bound nucleus and compartmentalized membrane-bound organelles (Mitochondria, ER, Golgi, Lysosomes). The cell membrane is governed by Singer and Nicolson's Fluid Mosaic Model.",
